  "summary": "The library advertises 277 AI expert agents spanning 20 departments, of which 213 are translations of the English upstream and 64 are original China-market additions. Each agent is defined as a persona with an identity, key rules, workflow, and deliverables, activated by natural language after installation into an AI coding tool. Evidence coverage: 146 of 367 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
